# Hello, Zolto!

This is a basic Zolto document — a strict superset of standard Markdown with zero dependencies.

## Inline Formatting

**Bold**, *italic*, `inline code`, ==highlighted==, ~~strikethrough~~, [link](https://example.com).

## Native Callout & Math

> [!NOTE]
> Every valid `.md` file is a valid `.zl` file.

Inline math: $E = mc^2$.

## Vector & Component Showcase

component Card(title, subtitle="", variant="default")
card variant=variant
### {title}
{subtitle}
slot
end
end

Card(title="Welcome to Zolto", subtitle="Phase 10 Interactive Document Engine", variant="primary")
Zolto combines Markdown, Math, Diagrams, Charts, Vectors, Spatial Layouts, Components, and Interactive Features into a single zero-dependency language.
end

## Interactive Form Showcase

@form contact {
  @text username required
  label "Username"

  @email email required
  label "Email"

  @button primary "Submit"
}

